<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0010/na_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasClassOfRecommendation> <http://digistrucmed.org/ClassOfRecommendation_I> .
