<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0010/tu_0007> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceGradeRecord> <http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0010/gr_0007> .
